            "review_text": "juns\n1 contribution\n0\nCold beer and various foods make you forget your worries.\nJul 2022\nThis is a place where you can come to be friendly with people.\nIt is a place I would like to visit again.\nThe atmosphere is nice and the people are lively.\nCold beer and various foods make you forget your worries.\nthere are good pub & Restaurant.\nwell make food & good service.\na low price & a fresh food.\nthere are an alive place..\nthere are a very interesting pub.\nI recommend it as a place where you can talk a lot while eating various foods here with your friends. \nI recommend it as a place where you can talk a lot while eating various foods here with your friends.\n50%, 100% good.\nI recommend it as a place where you can talk a lot while eating various foods here with your friends.\nover 50 words.. why not save it..done.. \n컨트리뷰터는 트립어드바이저의 단독 재량에 따라 결정되는 예외적인 경우를 제외하고, 트립어드바이저에 한 개의 계정만 보유할 수 있습니다. 여러 계정에서 동일한 리스팅에 리뷰를 제출하는 경우 중복된 제출을 삭제합니다.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 25, 2023",
