            "review_title": "Review at Hell Bull BBQ n Beer",
            "review_text": "Michael R\nWakefield, United Kingdom40 contributions\n0\nFantastic Value\nSep 2019\nWe decided to use the Hot Deals app to find a restaurant yesterday evening. The Hell Bull we visited was Hell Bull 3, situated just outside the very centre of Saigon, and as promised it really was an \"all you can eat\" BBQ buffet. We chose the freshest seafood - crab, crayfish, oysters, langoustine, as well as superb beef and chicken dishes all authentically spiced and delicious. All the food is cooked freshly to order, and for two of us including a couple of cokes, the cost was remarkably only 600,000 VND. Full price without the app was about 1,000,000. Make sure you ring them first to let them know what time you are going.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 26, 2019",
